Cell["\<\
This tutorial provide instruction on how to encode the rate law to the neural \
network for a simple first order reaction \
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.987287808436716*^9, 3.9872878108030167`*^9}, {
  3.987287950133061*^9, 
