9e4b47183072"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Compare to the Julia code in the Ji and Deng\[CloseCurlyQuote]s paper this is \
a more simple version. The next step can include modifying the code for more \
complex reaction like ones in the paper. \
\>", "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.987287808436716*^9, 3.9872878108030167`*^9}, {
